00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.493
CHAIR. AB 1755 IS A JOINT CALL

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.195
BILL TO ADDRESS THE RAPIDLY

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:24.931
GROWING BACKLOG OF CIVIL CASES

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:25.865
INVOLVING DISPUTES OVER

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.867
CALIFORNIA'S LEMON LAWS SINCE

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.035
THE END OF THE PANDEMIC ERA,

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.137
RESTRICTIONS ON COURT HEARINGS,

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:32.271
THE NUMBER OF LEMON LAW RELATED

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.107
LAWSUITS FILED IN CALIFORNIA HAS

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.174
DOUBLED. IN FACT, JUDGES REPORT

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:37.744
THAT IN LA COUNTY ALONE, LEMON

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.746
LAW CASES NOW REPRESENT 10% OF

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:42.181
ALL CIVIL FILINGS IN THE COUNTY.

00:04:42.248 --> 00:04:43.116
THE CORRESPONDING INCREASE IN

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:45.351
DISCOVERY DISPUTES, PROTRACTED

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:47.520
SETTLEMENT NEGOTIATIONS, AND

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:49.956
DISAGREEMENTS REGARDING FEES ARE

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:50.523
SIGNIFICANTLY DELAYING MANY

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.092
CALIFORNIANS ABILITY TO REPLACE

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:54.927
A DEFECTIVE CAR WITH A SAFE AND

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:56.763
RELIABLE FORM OF TRANSPORTATION.

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:58.931
AB 1755 REPRESENTS A COMPROMISE

00:04:58.998 --> 00:04:59.932
BETWEEN THE CONSUMER ATTORNEYS

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:02.135
DEFENSE ATTORNEYS AND SOME AUTO

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:04.037
MANUFACTURERS, MOST NOTABLY

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:06.005
GENERAL MOTORS. THE COMPROMISE

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:08.307
HAS THREE PRIMARY COMPONENTS.

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:09.375
FIRST, THE BILL ADOPTS NEW PRE

00:05:09.442 --> 00:05:11.210
LITIGATION PROCEDURES DESIGNED

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:12.879
TO KEEP DISPUTES FROM EVER GOING

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:14.147
TO COURT. CONSUMERS MUST NOW

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:15.248
INFORM MANUFACTURERS IN WRITING

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:17.216
IF THEY WANT A LEMON VEHICLE

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:18.217
BOUGHT BACK OR REPLACED.

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:19.786
OTHERWISE THEY FORGO THE ABILITY

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:22.422
TO SEEK CIVIL PENALTIES.

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:22.989
MANUFACTURERS RECEIVING THIS

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:24.490
NOTICE MUST AGREE TO REPLACE THE

00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:26.392
VEHICLE WITHIN 30 DAYS, OR ELSE

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:28.261
THE CONSUMER MAY GO TO COURT. IF

00:05:28.327 --> 00:05:29.429
THE PARTIES REACH AN AGREEMENT,

00:05:29.495 --> 00:05:30.430
THE MANUFACTURER MUST COMPLETE

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.065
THE REPURCHASE OR REPLACEMENT OF

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:34.233
THE VEHICLE WITHIN 60 DAYS.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.368
SECOND, IN THE EVENT A LAWSUIT

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:37.637
IS FILED, THE BILL ADOPTS

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:39.706
STREAMLINED EARLY DISCOVERY AND

00:05:39.772 --> 00:05:40.740
MEDIATION. PARTIES MUST PROVIDE

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:43.943
A MANDATORY SET OF DOCUMENTS AND

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.845
DISCOVERY WITHIN 60 DAYS OF THE

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:46.846
DEFENDANT RESPONDING TO THE

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:47.780
LAWSUIT. THE PLAINTIFF AND

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.382
DEFENDANT MUST SUBMIT TO A

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:50.450
DEPOSITION WITHIN 120 DAYS OF

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.852
THE DEFENDANT'S RESPONSE. BOTH

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:55.722
PARTIES MUST ATTEND MEDIATION

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:56.823
WITHIN 150 DAYS. FINALLY, BOTH

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:59.492
SIDES MUST HAVE A PERSON CAPABLE

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:01.728
OF SETTLING PRESENT AT THE

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:02.829
MEDIATION. THE PARTIES MAY SEEK

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:04.897
EXTENDED DISCOVERY AND

00:06:04.964 --> 00:06:05.998
LITIGATION ONLY IF THE EARLY

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:07.800
DISCOVERY AND MEDIATION FAIL. I

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.737
WANT TO CLARIFY THAT AMENDMENTS

00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:11.738
ADOPTED THIS MORNING CLARIFY

00:06:11.804 --> 00:06:14.073
THAT ANY RESPONSE FROM A

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.174
DEFENDANT TRIGGERS THE DISCOVERY

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:17.376
TIMELINES, NOT JUST AN ANSWER,

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:18.444
THUS ELIMINATING ANY CHANCE FOR

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:20.213
GAME PLAYING BY LITIGANTS. THE

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:22.782
BILL ALSO ENHANCES CERTAINTY AND

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:23.649
LITIGATION. TIMELINES AND

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:25.718
SETTLEMENTS. THE BILL NARROWS

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:27.954
THE TIMELINE FOR FILING LEMON

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.856
LAW CASES TO ONE YEAR AFTER THE

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:30.957
FINAL WARRANTY EXPIRES, OR SIX

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:32.125
YEARS TOTAL FROM DELIVERY OF A

00:06:32.191 --> 00:06:34.360
VEHICLE. THIS IS STILL MORE

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.028
GENEROUS THAN OTHER STATES. 47

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:37.130
STATES LIMIT THEIR LEMON LAW

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:39.532
REMEDIES TO THE YEAR OR TWO

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:40.933
AFTER A CAR IS PURCHASED, OR 18

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.170
TO 24,000 MILES. FINALLY THE

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:45.104
BILL EXPEDITES SETTLEMENT

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:47.373
COMPLETION BY PROVIDING ONE

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.374
STANDARD STATUTORY FORM FOR

00:06:48.441 --> 00:06:50.643
REPURCHASE, REPLACEMENT

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:51.644
AGREEMENTS, THUS ELIMINATING THE

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:53.012
NEED FOR NEGOTIATIONS REQUIRING

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:54.113
A SETTLEMENT TO BE COMPLETED IN

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.349
A TIMELY MANNER, OR ELSE BOTH

00:06:56.415 --> 00:06:57.450
SIDES FACE POSSIBLE CIVIL

00:06:57.517 --> 00:06:59.051
PENALTIES AND SANCTIONS, AND

00:06:59.118 --> 00:07:00.086
REQUIRING THE MANUFACTURER TO

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:02.688
PROVIDE THE CONSUMER A CHECK OR

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:04.690
A NEW VEHICLE. AT THE TIME, THE

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:05.758
LEMON IS TURNED IN. THESE

00:07:05.825 --> 00:07:08.194
CONSUMER FRIENDLY CHANGES SEEK

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.295
TO PROMOTE TIMELY RESOLUTION OF

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:11.397
CASES OUTSIDE THE COURT WHEN

00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:14.400
POSSIBLE. LASTLY, LET ME BRIEFLY

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:15.501
ADDRESS SOME CONCERNS THAT HAVE

00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:16.702
BEEN RAISED BY THE OPPOSITION

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:18.671
AND NOTE WHAT THE BILL DOES NOT

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:20.439
DO. THE BILL DOES NOT ALTER ANY

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:20.940
FUNDAMENTAL RIGHTS UNDER

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.441
EXISTING LEMON LAWS. MUCH LIKE

00:07:22.508 --> 00:07:23.276
TODAY, MANUFACTURERS ARE

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:24.343
OBLIGATED TO CONFORM VEHICLES TO

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.479
THEIR WARRANTY. SIMILARLY, THIS

00:07:26.546 --> 00:07:27.480
BILL DOES NOT CANCEL ANY

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:29.816
WARRANTY IF A WARRANTY ISSUE

00:07:29.882 --> 00:07:31.517
ARISES AT ANY TIME DURING A

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:32.752
WARRANTY'S EXISTENCE. THE

00:07:32.819 --> 00:07:33.920
EXISTING LAW RELATED TO WARRANTY

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:35.688
CONTRACTS STILL APPLIES THE

00:07:35.755 --> 00:07:36.722
STATUTE OF LIMITATIONS. THIS

00:07:36.789 --> 00:07:38.424
BILL DOES NOT IMPACT THE

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:39.525
WARRANTY CLAIMS. THIS BILL DOES

00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:41.794
NOT SHIFT ANY BURDENS ON

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:42.895
PLAINTIFFS. IT MERELY CODIFIES

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:44.764
EXISTING PRACTICES AND ON THE

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:45.932
GROUND REALITIES RELATED TO

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:47.533
NOTIFYING MANUFACTURERS ABOUT A

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:50.069
CAR BEING A LEMON, AND ONLY

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:51.170
APPLIES THESE TO ACTIONS SEEKING

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:53.139
CIVIL PENALTIES. THIS BILL DOES

00:07:53.206 --> 00:07:54.273
NOT ALTER A MANUFACTURER'S

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.808
AFFIRMATIVE DUTY TO REPLACE

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:56.976
LEMONS ONCE A VEHICLE HITS THE

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:59.011
REQUISITE NUMBER OF REPAIRS. IT

00:07:59.078 --> 00:08:00.012
SHOULD BE REPLACED OR

00:08:00.079 --> 00:08:00.980
REPURCHASED, AND DAMAGES CAN

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:02.048
BEGIN ACCRUING AT THAT TIME.

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:03.082
THIS BILL DOES NOT DELAY

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.484
LITIGATION OR PERMIT NEFARIOUS

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:06.419
LITIGATION TACTICS. RATHER, THIS

00:08:06.485 --> 00:08:08.187
BILL STREAMLINES DISCOVERY AND

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:09.088
ADOPTS SANCTIONS FOR BAD

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:11.023
BEHAVIOR. THIS BILL DOES NOT

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.258
GRANT NEW ATTORNEYS FEES. GIVEN

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:13.759
THAT THE ATTORNEY CLIENT

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:15.061
PRIVILEGE ATTACHES BEFORE A

00:08:15.127 --> 00:08:16.662
LAWSUIT IS FILED, FEES FOR PRE

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:17.597
LITIGATION ACTIVITIES ARE

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:19.532
TYPICALLY COVERED UNDER EXISTING

00:08:19.599 --> 00:08:20.733
LAW. THIS BILL DOES NOT CHANGE

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.035
THAT. FINALLY, THIS BILL DOES

00:08:23.102 --> 00:08:24.170
NOT AUTHORIZE BULK SETTLEMENTS

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:26.138
MUCH LIKE EXISTING LAW. THIS

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:28.140
BILL DEALS WITH ONE PLAINTIFF

00:08:28.207 --> 00:08:29.342
AND ONE DEFENDANT AT A TIME, AND

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:31.744
IN NO WAY AUTHORIZES NEW CLASS

00:08:31.811 --> 00:08:32.845
ACTIONS OR THE GROUPING OF

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:33.913
DISTINCT CLAIMS FROM DISTINCT

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.014
PARTIES. THIS BILL SIMPLY SEEKS

00:08:35.081 --> 00:08:36.649
TO PROVIDE A PROCESS FOR THE

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:37.717
EXPEDITIOUS RESOLUTION OF LEMON

00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:40.319
LAW CLAIMS BY INCENTIVIZING ALL

00:08:40.386 --> 00:08:42.555
PARTIES TO REACH EARLY AND

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:43.556
AMICABLE OUTCOMES. HERE TO

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.691
TESTIFY IN SUPPORT ARE GREG

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:47.560
RIZZO, ON BEHALF OF THE CONSUMER

00:08:47.627 --> 00:08:48.661
ATTORNEYS OF CALIFORNIA, AND

00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:49.462
MIKE BOEHLERT ON BEHALF OF

00:08:49.528 --> 00:08:53.566
GENERAL MOTORS. ALL RIGHT. THANK

00:08:53.633 --> 00:08:55.334
YOU, MR. RIZZO. THE FLOOR IS

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:57.370
YOURS. THANK YOU, MR. CHAIR.

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.238
GOOD AFTERNOON, SENATORS. MY

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:01.173
NAME IS GREG RIZZO. I AM THE

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:01.974
