00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:02.541
CALIFORNIA'S IMMEDIATE PAST

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:04.911
PRESIDENT AND ONE OF THE CHIEF

00:09:04.977 --> 00:09:07.213
NEGOTIATORS ON AB 1755. I THINK

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.216
IT'S IMPORTANT FOR ALL OF YOU TO

00:09:10.283 --> 00:09:11.918
