00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:23.229
CONGESTION PROBLEM. SITTING ON A

00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:26.666
BUNCH OF BOARDS WITH JUDGES AND

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:28.434
LAWYERS, I CAN TELL YOU THAT ALL

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:29.602
OF US KNOW THAT LEMON LAW

00:09:29.669 --> 00:09:31.370
DISCOVERY FILINGS ARE KILLING

00:09:31.437 --> 00:09:32.405
THE CONSUMER'S RIGHTS TO GET

00:09:32.471 --> 00:09:36.208
