00:09:36.275 --> 00:09:37.310
SINCE 2022, LEMON LAW FILINGS

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:41.180
HAVE DOUBLED FROM 15,000 PER

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:44.583
YEAR TO 30 SINCE 2014. LEMON LAW

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:48.888
FILINGS HAVE INCREASED OVER

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:51.190
$25,000.20 5000 CASES A YEAR.

00:09:51.257 --> 00:09:52.325
THAT'S 30,000 CASES THAT WILL BE

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:54.327
FILED THIS YEAR. FURTHER

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:56.896
CONGESTED COURTS THAT ARE

00:09:56.963 --> 00:09:58.931
ALREADY BACKLOGGED FROM THE 2020

00:09:58.998 --> 00:10:01.667
COVID PANDEMIC. AS I SAID

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:04.236
BEFORE, AB 1755 FIXES THE COURTS

00:10:04.303 --> 00:10:06.439
CONGESTION PROBLEMS BY CHANGING

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:09.075
THE COURT PROCESSES WITHOUT

00:10:09.141 --> 00:10:11.677
AFFECTING THE CONSUMERS RIGHTS.

00:10:11.744 --> 00:10:14.413
THE AFFIRMATIVE DUTIES REMAIN.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:18.918
THE WARRANTY RIGHTS REMAIN. AB

00:10:18.985 --> 00:10:19.986
1755 IMPOSES STRICT DEADLINES ON

00:10:20.052 --> 00:10:23.122
PRE FILING PROCEDURES TO HELP

00:10:23.189 --> 00:10:25.591
IDENTIFY AND GET. LEMON LAW CARS

00:10:25.658 --> 00:10:28.728
GET LEMON CARS OFF THE ROAD

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:29.929
WITHIN 60 DAYS OF A COMPLAINT.

00:10:29.996 --> 00:10:32.765
AND IF THEY'RE NOT OFF THE ROAD

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:35.034
